RECORDS REQUESTED:

All call logs, text message logs, data usage logs, and account records associated
with the cellular telephone number(s) registered to or used by {{ defendant_name }}
for the following date and time window:

        Date:          {{ incident_date }}
        Time window:   7:30 AM PST through 7:50 AM PST

Specifically, produce:

    (1) All outgoing and incoming call records (number called/received, timestamp,
        duration) for the above date and time window;

    (2) All outgoing and incoming text message metadata (number sent/received,
        timestamp) for the above date and time window — message content is NOT
        requested at this time;

    (3) Mobile data connection logs showing whether a data connection was active
        during the above date and time window;

    (4) Account holder name, service address, and account number associated with
        the device(s) in use during the above date and time window.

RELEVANCE:

This subpoena is issued in connection with a civil action in which it is alleged
that {{ defendant_name }} was operating a motor vehicle while texting or using a
handheld wireless device in violation of California Vehicle Code § 23123.5 at
{{ incident_location }} on {{ incident_date }}, proximately causing injury to
{{ plaintiff_name }}.

